const sections=[["Controller and scope", "The controller is Carlos Cabanas, Gral. Lavalle 1126, (1646) San Fernando, Buenos Aires Province, Argentina, editor of MARTINFIERRO.ORG, an independent digital publication (see the <a href='/aviso-legal/' lang='es'>legal notice</a>, in Spanish). This policy covers every page on martinfierro.org in every language."], ["What data is processed", "We have no registration and no forms that store names, emails or other personal data. Cloudflare (delivery and security) and GitHub (code hosting) receive standard technical data from each visit, such as IP address, requested page, browser, date and time. Some pages embed documents or images hosted elsewhere (Internet Archive, Wikimedia Commons, libraries and public bodies), which receive the same technical data when loaded."], ["Advertising", "MARTINFIERRO.ORG <strong>will display advertising</strong> to fund the edition, served by networks such as <strong>Google AdSense</strong> and by direct advertisers. Every placement will be labelled “Advertisement” and kept separate from editorial content. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar identifiers to show ads based on previous visits to this and other sites, cap frequency and measure performance. See <a href='https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites'>How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>."], ["Cookies", "The site sets no first-party cookies to identify you. Cookies that may appear: <strong>technical and security</strong> (Cloudflare); <strong>advertising</strong> (Google and other advertisers); <strong>embedded content</strong> (Internet Archive, Wikimedia Commons and others); and a <strong>consent</strong> cookie storing your choice."], ["Visitors from the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland (GDPR)", "<strong>Legal bases:</strong> technical delivery and security data, legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR); advertising cookies and personalised ads, your consent (Art. 6(1)(a)), which you can withdraw at any time; replying to your messages, Art. 6(1)(b) or legitimate interest.<br><strong>Consent first:</strong> when ads are switched on, visitors in these countries will first see a consent message from a Google-certified consent platform compatible with the IAB Europe TCF. No advertising cookie is set without your acceptance; if you decline, only non-personalised ads are shown. You can change your choice at any time from the “Privacy and cookies” link in the footer.<br><strong>Recipients:</strong> Cloudflare, GitHub, Google and its advertising partners (with consent where required).<br><strong>International transfers:</strong> the controller is in Argentina, recognised by the European Commission as providing adequate protection (Decision 2003/490/EC). Cloudflare, GitHub and Google may process data in the United States and elsewhere under safeguards such as the EU-US Data Privacy Framework or standard contractual clauses.<br><strong>Retention:</strong> we keep no reader data; provider logs follow their policies; emails you send are kept only as long as needed to reply. Each advertising cookie's lifetime is shown in the consent message.<br><strong>Your rights:</strong> access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection and withdrawal of consent, and the right to complain to your national data protection authority.<br><strong>No automated decisions</strong> with legal effects are made about you."], ["Your choices", "Turn off Google personalised ads at <a href='https://adssettings.google.com/'>My Ad Center</a>; other companies at <a href='https://optout.aboutads.info/'>aboutads.info</a> or <a href='https://www.youronlinechoices.eu/'>youronlinechoices.eu</a>. You can delete or block cookies in your browser; the site remains fully readable."], ["Children", "The site is educational and suitable for all ages. It does not knowingly collect children's personal data and its ad placements will not be used to target personalised ads at children."], ["Data rights and contact", "Argentina's <a href='https://www.argentina.gob.ar/normativa/nacional/ley-25326-64790/actualizacion'>Law 25,326</a> also applies. To exercise your rights, use the channel on the <a href='/en/contact/'>contact page</a>. For data processed by Google or other advertisers you may also contact them directly."], ["Changes", "Before any new ad network, audience measurement or other data-processing service is activated, this page will be updated with a new date. The Spanish version is the reference text."]];
