<article class="legal-en"><p class="eyebrow">LEGAL INFORMATION · 15 NOVEMBER 2026</p><h1>Privacy and Cookie Policy</h1><p class="lead">MARTINFIERRO.ORG is free to read. To fund it, the site will display advertising. This page explains what data is processed, who receives it and what choices you have.</p>{sections.map(([heading,body],i)=><section><h2>{heading}</h2><p set:html={body}/></section>)}<footer><p>This English page describes the same underlying project as its Spanish counterpart. In case of a material discrepancy, consult the original project documentation and request an editorial correction; neither version is represented as independently certified legal advice.</p><a href="/en/contact/">Contact and corrections</a></footer></article>
